Third-party code
================

Closer began as a fork of AssemblyAI's JavaScript voice agent starter,
https://github.com/AssemblyAI/voice-agent-starter-js, published by AssemblyAI
for builders on their Voice Agent API. The files derived from it are named in
AGENTS.md, and local changes inside the vendored browser client carry a
MODIFICA LOCALE comment.

Checked 26/09/2026: that repository ships no licence file of its own, so the MIT
grant in LICENSE covers this project's code and not the upstream portions, which
remain AssemblyAI's.

This note lives here rather than at the end of LICENSE because GitHub only
detects a licence when LICENSE holds the licence text and nothing else: with the
note appended, the repository reported NOASSERTION instead of MIT, and the point
of the file is the signal it sends to someone checking.
